Harsh-Review-Attacked: whether the path encoding was duplicated; named_snapshot_path and snapshot_path both go through segment_path, which also refuses an empty value naming what was missing.
Harsh-Review-Attacked: whether the answer types are guessed; snapshot.list, snapshot.latest and snapshot.tree are the type constants Boat's OpenAPI document gives those answers, and the file is read as bytes as the document gives it.
